eeded considerable work before its people could feel established.\0311,1,268,2,271,1,0\0302,1,66,2,128,1,0\0303,1,113,4,48,1,0\031246349,2,1,Breton Samuels\030246378,2,1,Danitha Morr\031\031\031",["quest"]="Touring the Grounds\031The charge was to meet the keep's residents and seek Danitha Morr.\031246349\031246378\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="0630c919d46210f712ccbdaaf94dec618adcecdfd98211b8a2f948737a82d4c9",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/91294",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
[91316]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="Jorin planned to send Breton and other recruits back to retrieve whatever remained in the cellar.",["atomIDs"]={"91316:description:1-212","91316:objective:1-71"},["editorialVersion"]="codex-forsaken-1",["endingAtomIDs"]={"91316:completion:1-97"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_NO_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES",["opening"]="Distance from the Undercity made even ordinary building supplies hard to obtain. Jorin Croge looked toward ruined Shadowvale, where an old root cellar might still hold materials useful to Bandarion's restoration.",["pending"]="{actor} would search Shadowvale for twelve pieces of sturdy lumber.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} supplied Jorin with the lumber recovered from Shadowvale.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="5614ce931b65a2e78930fb0c188e85835c10774421851ca82f00daaec807d77d",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-91316.html",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/91316",["title"]="Making Repairs"},["following"]={},["meta"]="RECOVER\031?\03111\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0315614ce931b65a2e78930fb0c188e85835c10774421851ca82f00daaec807d77d\031246393:GIVER",["people"]={[246393]="Jorin Croge"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Distance from the Undercity made even ordinary building supplies hard to obtain. Jorin Croge looked toward ruined Shadowvale, where an old root cellar might still hold materials useful to Bandarion's restoration.\030The charge was to search Shadowvale for twelve pieces of sturdy lumber.\030Jorin planned to send Breton and other recruits back to retrieve whatever remained in the cellar.\0311,1,212,2,271,1,0\0302,1,71,2,128,1,0\0303,1,97,4,48,1,0\031246393,2,1,Jorin Croge\031\031\031",["que