[92514]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="The constable described Shen’dar as a place where the High Order and Windshapers kept their tensions civil in the face of larger dangers. With the introductions made, a local bandit problem still needed attention.",["atomIDs"]={"92514:description:1-234","92514:objective:1-83"},["completionSource"]="PUBLIC_BETA_COMPLETION_ACCOUNT",["editorialEpisode"]="Shen'dar introductions",["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"92514:completion:1-215"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Constable Aonda recognizes a Windshaper's touch before any work has begun. Shen'dar Village has room for both spiritual counsel and ordinary hospitality: Illaya Amberwind waits near its center, while Coriella Calmbreeze keeps the inn.",["pending"]="{actor} would introduce themselves to Illaya Amberwind and Coriella Calmbreeze.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} made the village introductions. Aonda acknowledged the uneasy civility between Windshapers and High Order, then raised the matter of the local bandits.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="2ceb4e3cede6aa1649356c8a5aea2847a4fa4c4b68cbd907f77fab2697946bca",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-92514.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="DESCRIPTION_OBJECTIVE_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92514",["title"]="Welcome to Shen'dar Village"},["following"]={},["meta"]="SPEAK\031?\0316\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0312ceb4e3cede6aa1649356c8a5aea2847a4fa4c4b68cbd907f77fab2697946bca\031251523:GIVER",["people"]={[251523]="Constable Aonda"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Constable Aonda recognizes a Windshaper's touch before any work has begun. Shen'dar Village has room for both spiritual counsel and ordinary hospitality: Illaya Amberwind waits near its center, while Coriella Calmbreeze keeps the inn.\030The charge was to introduce themselves to Illaya Amberwind and Coriella Calmbreeze.\030The constable described Shen’dar as a place where the High Order and Windshapers kept their tensions civil in the face of larger dangers. With the introductions made, a local bandit problem still needed attention.\0311,1,234,2,271,1,0\0302,1,83,2,128,1,0\0303,1,215,4,48,1,0\031251523,2,1,Constable Aonda\031\031\031",["quest"]="Welcome to Shen'dar Village\031The charge was to introduce themselves to Illaya Amberwind and Coriella Calmbreeze.\031251523\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="2ceb4e3cede6aa1649356c8a5aea2847a4fa4c4b68cbd907f77fab2697946bca",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92514",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
