aw Pelts in the Shen'dar Highlands.\030Indari accepted the pelts and acknowledged the unpleasant work that had brought them back.\0311,1,200,2,271,1,0\0302,1,71,2,128,1,0\0303,1,90,4,48,1,0\031251993,2,1,Indari Sunseam\031\031\031",["quest"]="The Problem With Prideclaws\031The charge was to gather ten Prideclaw Pelts in the Shen'dar Highlands.\031251993\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="0f58440c724410717f95f0b321a2bfa67a4b22544ecd81e10bf92132a329bae8",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92515",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
