[92528]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="The report placed Lorthuna herself with the cult and exposed plans against Shen’dar and the western watchtower. The tower’s minor apparent value remained a puzzle, even as the villagers prepared to resist.",["atomIDs"]={"92528:description:1-247","92528:objective:1-90"},["completionSource"]="PUBLIC_BETA_COMPLETION_ACCOUNT",["editorialEpisode"]="The highlands cult investigation",["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"92528:completion:1-209"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Missionary Jasaan welcomes an apparent recruit into Falaath Village, where the Al'Aketh proclaim their growing strength. Skypriest Aanders is entertaining an important guest at the northern inn, a place Jasaan pointedly asks the newcomer to avoid.",["pending"]="{actor} would investigate Falaath Village and carry useful intelligence back to Aonda.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} brought Aonda word of Lorthuna's presence and plans against Shen'dar and the western watchtower. The tower's importance remained unexplained, but the constable began preparing for an attack.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="1a3b98043ea3af2b7dd5f273d3f190905f0ca96c08788133d3d706a85f9630de",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-92528.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="DESCRIPTION_OBJECTIVE_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92528",["title"]="Among the Faithful"},["following"]={},["meta"]="INVESTIGATE\031?\0318\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0311a3b98043ea3af2b7dd5f273d3f190905f0ca96c08788133d3d706a85f9630de\031257065:GIVER,251523:FINISHER",["people"]={[251523]="Constable Aonda",[257065]="Missionary Jasaan"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Missionary Jasaan welcomes an apparent recruit into Falaath Village, where the Al'Aketh proclaim their growing strength. Skypriest Aanders is entertaining an important guest at the northern inn, a place Jasaan pointedly asks the newcomer to avoid.\030The charge was to investigate Falaath Village and carry useful intelligence back to Aonda.\030The report placed Lorthuna herself with the cult and exposed plans against Shen’dar and the western watchtower. The tower’s minor apparent value remained a puzzle, even as the villagers prepared to resist.\0311,1,247,2,271,1,0\0302,1,90,2,128,1,0\0303,1,209,4,48,1,0\031257065,2,1,Missionary Jasaan\030251523,2,1,Constable Aonda\031\031\031",["quest"]="Among the Faithful\031The charge was to investigate Falaath Village and carry useful intelligence back to Aonda.\031257065\031251523\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="1a3b98043ea3af2b7dd5f273d3f190905f0ca96c08788133d3d706a85f9630de",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92528",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
