eker to Missionary Jasaan at Falaath Village; her account of the spirits' departure remains the cult's own claim.\030The charge was to approach Jasaan under the Mark of Akir.\030Jasaan welcomed Sania’s marked recruit as another acolyte blessed by Al’Akir’s winds.\0311,1,266,2,271,1,0\0302,1,57,2,128,1,0\0303,1,91,4,48,1,0\031251904,2,1,Sania Silverstream\030257065,2,1,Missionary Jasaan\031\031\031",["quest"]="Falaath Village\031The charge was to approach Jasaan under the Mark of Akir.\031251904\031257065\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="633db4e37bdcb21f12a329db3696d75d99c1583928c6d30deadfa04e76c45624",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92529",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
