[94438]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="Falgan recognized the talisman from the days before the war. Restored, he confirmed that Scarlet activity still threatened the Forsaken.",["atomIDs"]={"94438:description:1-252","94438:objective:1-72"},["editorialVersion"]="codex-forsaken-1",["endingAtomIDs"]={"94438:completion:1-136"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_NO_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES",["opening"]="Billmuth and Falgan had overheard Scarlet plans for an attack on Brill while scouting Venomweb Vale. Discovery forced Billmuth to flee, and Falgan never followed. Billmuth's plea now concerned the friend he feared had stayed behind to cover his escape.",["pending"]="{actor} would find Falgan and use the Symbol of Life to restore him.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} restored Deathguard Falgan with the Symbol of Life.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="9140f448f8c2ceaf690d6b6ba87ac040537d82087b60807693d1e220ff7f884e",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-94438.html",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94438",["title"]="A Lesson in Divinity"},["following"]={},["meta"]="DELIVER\031?\03112\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0319140f448f8c2ceaf690d6b6ba87ac040537d82087b60807693d1e220ff7f884e\031257655:GIVER,257663:FINISHER",["people"]={[257655]="Deathguard Billmuth",[257663]="Deathguard Falgan"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Billmuth and Falgan had overheard Scarlet plans for an attack on Brill while scouting Venomweb Vale. Discovery forced Billmuth to flee, and Falgan never followed. Billmuth's plea now concerned the friend he feared had stayed behind to cover his escape.\030The charge was to find Falgan and use the Symbol of Life to restore him.\030Falgan recognized the talisman from the days before the war. Restored, he confirmed that Scarlet activity still threatened the Forsaken.\0311,1,252,2,271,1,0\0302,1,72,2,128,1,0\0303,1,136,4,48,1,0\031257655,2,1,Deathguard Billmuth\030257663,2,1,Deathguard Falgan\031\031\031",["quest"]="A Lesson in Divinity\031The charge was to find Falgan and use the Symbol of Life to restore him.\031257655\031257663\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="9140f448f8c2ceaf690d6b6ba87ac040537d82087b60807693d1e220ff7f884e",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94438",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
[94440]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="Billmuth intended to carry the plans to his commander. Saving Falgan had also changed his view of the paladins of Tyr's Watch.",["atomIDs"]={"94440:description:1-229","94440:objective:1-77"},["editorialVersion"]="codex-forsaken-1",["endingAtomIDs"]={"94440:completion:1-126"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_NO_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES",["opening"]="Falgan knew an attack was coming, but warning alone would not reveal its shape. Scarlet satchels could hold deployment orders; with those in hand, the deathguard might prepare an ambush instead of waiting blindly for the assault.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover the Scarlet attack plans and take them to Billmuth.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Scarlet attack plans to Deathguard Billmuth.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="7969d8038b72581239d7e6a5efa7a0cc2d207b2c7b977ff121427afc0d81a8b3",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-94440.html",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94440",["title"]="A Lesson in Divinity"},["following"]={},["meta"]="RECOVER\031?\03112\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0317969d8038b72581239d7e6a5efa7a0cc2d207b2c7b977ff121427afc0d81a8b3\031257663:GIVER,257655:FINISHER",["people"]={[257655]="Deathguard Billmuth",[257663]="Deathguard Falgan"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Falgan knew an attack was coming, but warning alone would not reveal its shape. Scarlet satchels could hold deployment orders; with those in hand, the deathguard might prepare an ambush instead of waiting blindly for the assault.\030The charge was to recover the Scarlet attack plans and take them to Billmuth.\030Billmuth intended to carry the plans to his commander. Saving Falgan had also changed his view of the paladins of Tyr's Watch.\0311,1,229,2,271,1,0\0302,1,77,2,128,1,0\0303,1,126,4,48,1,0\031257663,2,1,Deathguard Falgan\030257655,2,1,Deathguard Billmuth\031\031\031",["quest"]="A Lesson in Divinity\031The charge was to recover the Scarlet attack plans and take them to Billmuth.\031257663\031257655\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="7969d8038b72581239d7e6a5efa7a0cc2d207b2c7b977ff121427afc0d81a8b3",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94440",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
