[94484]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="Elegael’s relief vanished when it became clear the conclave’s message had never reached Lotheluum. There were no expected reinforcements; the druids would have to act with what help had arrived.",["atomIDs"]={"94484:description:1-252","94484:objective:1-74"},["completionSource"]="PUBLIC_BETA_COMPLETION_ACCOUNT",["editorialEpisode"]="The Nightclaw aftermath",["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"94484:completion:1-198"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Lotheluum Starbreeze has waited too long for a message from the druid enclave in Shadowgale Forest. With Ban'aethal ruined and the island in turmoil, he asks someone headed northeast to find Elegael Thornpaw and discover why the correspondence stopped.",["pending"]="{actor} would find Elegael Thornpaw in northeastern Shadowgale Forest.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} reached Elegael, who first mistook the arrival for an answer to her plea for reinforcements. Learning that her message had never arrived left her facing the emergency with the help at hand.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="1251adecd3205c9ed758e11ab257f3618fa4129578893b590ab74a0037339b91",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-94484.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="DESCRIPTION_OBJECTIVE_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94484",["title"]="Unnerving Silence"},["following"]={},["meta"]="SPEAK\031?\03111\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0311251adecd3205c9ed758e11ab257f3618fa4129578893b590ab74a0037339b91\031252359:GIVER,257944:FINISHER",["people"]={[252359]="Lotheluum Starbreeze",[257944]="Elegael Thornpaw"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Lotheluum Starbreeze has waited too long for a message from the druid enclave in Shadowgale Forest. With Ban'aethal ruined and the island in turmoil, he asks someone headed northeast to find Elegael Thornpaw and discover why the correspondence stopped.\030The charge was to find Elegael Thornpaw in northeastern Shadowgale Forest.\030Elegael’s relief vanished when it became clear the conclave’s message had never reached Lotheluum. There were no expected reinforcements; the druids would have to act with what help had arrived.\0311,1,252,2,271,1,0\0302,1,74,2,128,1,0\0303,1,198,4,48,1,0\031252359,2,1,Lotheluum Starbreeze\030257944,2,1,Elegael Thornpaw\031\031\031",["quest"]="Unnerving Silence\031The charge was to find Elegael Thornpaw in northeastern Shadowgale Forest.\031252359\031257944\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="1251adecd3205c9ed758e11ab257f3618fa4129578893b590ab74a0037339b91",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94484",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
[94485]={["editorial"]={["atomIDs"]={"94485:description:1-215","94485:objective:1-58"},["editorialEpisode"]="The Nightclaw aftermath",["editorialVersion"]=1,["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Elegael needs Lady's Tear Moss for the wounded druids left in the den. Its sticky sap can bind and cleanse their injuries; she has exhausted what she can reach and asks for more from the bases of Shadowgale's trees.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather eight pieces of Lady's Tear Moss.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} brought Elegael the moss. She accepted the ingredient with relief, another necessity secured for the poultices.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="5c7de409fcb9dcb5a228abaca7f5a8773fa3a13e66961350d9a3fbb362c36cc7",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-94485.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="OBJECTIVE_DESCRIPTION_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94485",["title"]="Tears of the Lady"},["following"]={},["meta"]="RECOVER\031?\03112\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0315c7de409fcb9dcb5a228abaca7f5a8773fa3a13e66961350d9a3fbb362c36cc7\031257944:GIVER",["people"]={[257944]="Elegael Thornpaw"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Elegael needs Lady's Tear Moss for the wounded druids left in the den. Its sticky sap can bind and cleanse their injuries; she has exhausted what she can reach and asks for more from the bases of Shadowgale's trees.\030The charge was to gather eight pieces of Lady's Tear Moss.\030The quest participant brought Elegael the moss. She accepted the ingredient with relief, another necessity secured for the poultices.\0311,1,215,2,271,1,0\0302,1,58,2,128,1,0\0303,1,133,4,48,1,0\031257944,2,1,Elegael Thornpaw\031\031\031",["quest"]="Tears of the Lady\