[94487]={["editorial"]={["atomIDs"]={"94487:description:1-217","94487:objective:1-88"},["editorialEpisode"]="The Nightclaw aftermath",["editorialVersion"]=1,["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="The Al'Aketh ambush has driven Elegael to bitter anger at her own people's attackers. She asks for the heirlooms carried by the cult's footsoldiers and stormchasers, denouncing their right to the traditions they wear.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover ten Bloodied Heirlooms from the cultists in Shadowgale Forest.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} returned the bloodied heirlooms. Looking over them, Elegael grieved the lost young lives and resolved to preserve the objects for return to the High Elder.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="4b3b837869981a7c17b049ee805f158a8687e7c200363794878d1430fd9491fd",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-94487.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="OBJECTIVE_DESCRIPTION_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94487",["title"]="Unwanted and Unworthy"},["following"]={},["meta"]="RECOVER\031?\03111\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0314b3b837869981a7c17b049ee805f158a8687e7c200363794878d1430fd9491fd\031257944:GIVER",["people"]={[257944]="Elegael Thornpaw"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031The Al'Aketh ambush has driven Elegael to bitter anger at her own people's attackers. She asks for the heirlooms carried by the cult's footsoldiers and stormchasers, denouncing their right to the traditions they wear.\030The charge was to recover ten Bloodied Heirlooms from the cultists in Shadowgale Forest.\030The quest participant returned the bloodied heirlooms. Looking over them, Elegael grieved the lost young lives and resolved to preserve the objects for return to the High Elder.\0311,1,217,2,271,1,0\0302,1,88,2,128,1,0\0303,1,177,4,48,1,0\031257944,2,1,Elegael Thornpaw\031\031\031",["quest"]="Unwanted and Unworthy\031The charge was to recover ten Bloodied Heirlooms from the cultists in Shadowgale Forest.\031257944\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="4b3b837869981a7c17b049ee805f158a8687e7c200363794878d1430fd9491fd",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94487",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
[94488]={["editorial"]={["atomIDs"]={"94488:description:1-197","94488:objective:1-73"},["editorialEpisode"]="The Nightclaw aftermath",["editorialVersion"]=1,["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Elegael recognizes a terrible familiarity among the cultists: Haalien, a druid from their own circle who disappeared months earlier. She demands his head for the bloodshed now inflicted on his kin.",["pending"]="{actor} would defeat Commander Haalien and bring his head to Elegael.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} returned with Haalien's head. Only then did Elegael explain the closest bond in the betrayal: Haalien had been her cousin.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="5414dc1db2fc14dc944afcd4b1349fb95aaad94fd40c0415c42e88860904d53e",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-94488.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="OBJECTIVE_DESCRIPTION_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94488",["title"]="The Ties That Bind"},["following"]={},["meta"]="DEFEAT\031?\03111\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0315414dc1db2fc14dc944afcd4b1349fb95aaad94fd40c0415c42e88860904d53e\031257944:GIVER",["people"]={[257944]="Elegael Thornpaw"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Elegael recognizes a terrible familiarity among the cultists: Haalien, a druid from their own circle who disappeared months earlier. She demands his head for the bloodshed now inflicted on his kin.\030The charge was to defeat Commander Haalien and bring his head to Elegael.\030The quest participant returned with Haalien's head. Only then did Elegael explain the closest bond in the betrayal: Haalien had been her cousin.\0311,1,197,2,271,1,0\0302,1,73,2,128,1,0\0303,1,144,4,48,1,0\031257944,2,1,Elegael Thornpaw\031\031\031",["quest"]="The Ties That Bind\031The charge was to defeat Commander Haalien and bring his head to Elegael.\031257944\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="5414dc1db2fc14dc944afcd4b1349fb95aaad94fd40c0415c42e88860904d53e",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94488",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
[94489]={["editorial"]={["atomIDs"]={"94489:description:1-185","94489:objective:1-62"},["editorialEpisode"]="The Nightclaw aftermath",["editorialVersion"]=1,["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="The poultices are ready, and Elegael sends them to druids too badly hurt to heal themselves. She also asks after Jorel Windsinger, her mate, whom she left grievously wounded in the den.",["pending"]="{actor} would heal seven druids and find Jorel Windsinger.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} reported the druids' condition and Jorel's fate to Elegael. Her reply broke into grief and a vow of vengeance; the details should go no further than the events actually learned.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="79aeb0e8e8b235f77fa869f9ffcb5e75575a61c54b1884fee4581496e776a2e2",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-94489.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="OBJECTIVE_DESCRIPTION_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94489",["title"]="The Wounds of Betrayal"},["following"]={},["meta"]="RECOVER\031?\03112\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\03179aeb0e8e8b235f77fa869f9ffcb5e75575a61c54b1884fee4581496e776a2e2\031257944:GIVER",["people"]={[257944]="Elegael Thornpaw"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031The poultices are ready, and Elegael sends them to druids too badly hurt to heal themselves. She also asks after Jorel Windsinger, her mate, whom she left grievously wounded in the den.\030The charge was to heal seven druids and find Jorel Windsinger.\030The quest participant reported the druids' condition and Jorel's fate to Elegael. Her reply broke into grief and a vow of vengeance; the details should go no further than the events actually learned.\0311,1,185,2,271,1,0\0302,1,62,2,128,1,0\0303,1,199,4,48,1,0\031257944,2,1,Elegael Thornpaw\031\031\031",["quest"]="The Wounds of Betrayal\031The charge was to heal seven druids and find Jorel Windsinger.\031257944\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="79aeb0e8e8b235f77fa869f9ffcb5e75575a61c54b1884fee4581496e776a2e2",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94489",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
