[95042]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="Ulric judged the Kor Gem’s corruption simple to dispel for the intended craft, yet coveted the naga witches’ power for his own studies and asked whether the seeker would sell it instead.",["atomIDs"]={"95042:description:1-175","95042:objective:1-63"},["completionSource"]="PUBLIC_BETA_COMPLETION_ACCOUNT",["editorialEpisode"]="The Moonsilver Blade",["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"95042:completion:1-190"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Ulric Frostveil knows that paladins use Kor Gems to empower weapons. The naga of Blackfathom Deeps still possess them, though he warns that securing one is no solitary errand.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Ulric a Kor Gem from Blackfathom Deeps.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} delivered the gem. Ulric identified its corruption as removable for the intended purpose, while revealing his own interest in purchasing it for research.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="6990c857f2531f7af90d781fded65c6a6f64f88624bdec11be76d0d5403d097d",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-95042.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="DESCRIPTION_OBJECTIVE_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/95042",["title"]="Seeking the Kor Gem"},["following"]={},["meta"]="UNKNOWN\031?\031?\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0316990c857f2531f7af90d781fded65c6a6f64f88624bdec11be76d0d5403d097d\031259649:GIVER",["people"]={[259649]="Ulric Frostveil"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Ulric Frostveil knows that paladins use Kor Gems to empower weapons. The naga of Blackfathom Deeps still possess them, though he warns that securing one is no solitary errand.\030The charge was to bring Ulric a Kor Gem from Blackfathom Deeps.\