 was to recover eight Bottles of Whispering Elixir for Carolai in Brill.\030Carolai dismissed warnings about Shadowvale’s evil as superstition. She acknowledged rumors of a curse carried by the elixir, then paid for the recovered bottles.\0311,1,187,2,271,1,0\0302,1,82,2,128,1,0\0303,1,164,4,48,1,0\0312132,2,1,Carolai Anise\031\031\031",["quest"]="That Shadowvale Green Elixir\031The charge was to recover eight Bottles of Whispering Elixir for Carolai in Brill.\0312132\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="477de7f18b673aaad5960f7d0f942b27c8f44f6ca580187d0285c19fd784923c",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/95314",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
