[96898]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="Hadric expected more crystal fragments to remain buried for years. Recovering the conspicuous shards could hinder the cult without cleansing every trace of the necropolis’s assault.",["atomIDs"]={"96898:description:1-213","96898:objective:1-60"},["completionSource"]="PUBLIC_BETA_COMPLETION_ACCOUNT",["editorialEpisode"]="Argent visitors in Tirisfal",["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"96898:completion:1-183"},["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Fragments of Naxxramas's shattered focusing crystal remain scattered around Undercity's approaches. Hadric suspects the cultists are seeking them and wants the conspicuous pieces secured before they can be reused.",["pending"]="{actor} would collect twelve Necrotic Crystal Fragments.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} returned the fragments to Hadric. He expected more to surface for years, but believed removing these pieces would hinder the Scourge's immediate work.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="92ca3e7936276f99661ccbd0cf092febbfe923b0e510baf1a2e6515fcc1b0d97",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-96898.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="DESCRIPTION_OBJECTIVE_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/96898",["title"]="Remnants of War"},["following"]={},["meta"]="RECOVER\031?\03113\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\03192ca3e7936276f99661ccbd0cf092febbfe923b0e510baf1a2e6515fcc1b0d97\031267009:GIVER",["people"]={[267009]="Hadric Harlson"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Fragments of Naxxramas's shattered focusing crystal remain scattered around Undercity's approaches. Hadric suspects the cultists are seeking them and wants the conspicuous pieces secured before they can be reused.