[97250]={["editorial"]={["aftermath"]="Logmar welcomed a victory at the border but still doubted Horde responsibility for the burned tavern, noting how much civilian travel depended on that route. He urged further investigation.",["atomIDs"]={"97250:description:1-229","97250:objective:1-84"},["completionSource"]="PUBLIC_BETA_COMPLETION_ACCOUNT",["editorialEpisode"]="The border and the burned tavern",["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"97250:completion:1-189"},["endingLimitation"]="The confrontation does not solve the arson.",["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="Grunt Logmar reports Alliance soldiers crossing the Barrens border after a tavern fire for which they blame the Horde. He admits the accusation is unproven, yet demands that the encroaching force be driven out before any inquiry.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront the soldiers at Dustwallow's border and return to Logmar.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} returned from the border fighting. Logmar called it a Horde victory, but still doubted Horde responsibility for the fire and suggested further investigation.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="64b50197b960f48a6c21c0ae6509dfe34b7f29f1518acc4dc49e5a4d4d4bbabf",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-97250.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="DESCRIPTION_OBJECTIVE_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/97250",["title"]="Wrongly Blamed, Justly Corrected"},["following"]={},["meta"]="DEFEAT\031?\03123\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\03164b50197b960f48a6c21c0ae6509dfe34b7f29f1518acc4dc49e5a4d4d4bbabf\0315911:GIVER",["people"]={[5911]="Grunt Logmar"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031Grunt Logmar reports Alliance soldiers crossing the Barrens border after a tavern fire for which they blame the Horde. He admits the accusation is unproven, yet demands that the encroaching force be driven out before any inquiry.\030The charge was to confront the soldiers at Dustwallow's border and return to Logmar.\030Logmar welcomed a victory at the border but still doubted Horde responsibility for the burned tavern, noting how much civilian travel depended on that route. He urged further investigation.\0311,1,229,2,271,1,0\0302,1,84,2,128,1,0\0303,1,189,4,48,1,0\0315911,2,1,Grunt Logmar\031\031\031",["quest"]="Wrongly Blamed, Justly Corrected\031The charge was to confront the soldiers at Dustwallow's border and return to Logmar.\0315911\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="64b50197b960f48a6c21c0ae6509dfe34b7f29f1518acc4dc49e5a4d4d4bbabf",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/97250",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
