[97288]={["editorial"]={["atomIDs"]={"97288:description:1-152","97288:objective:1-76"},["editorialEpisode"]="Othmar's unending torment",["editorialVersion"]=1,["formalChainEdges"]="SOURCE_BLOCKED_EXPLICIT_ID_EDGES_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_THIS_SOURCE",["opening"]="An abomination's severed head appears to have been reattached more than once. Someone in Undercity may recognize it and explain the strange workmanship.",["pending"]="{actor} would deliver the Abominable Head to Master Apothecary Faranell.",["readyForFullFieldCompletion"]=false,["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_OBSERVATION_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_AUTHENTICATED",["result"]="{actor} brought the head to Faranell. He recognized a cruel joke of Sylvanas's making and immediately saw another use for it.",["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="2d961a808ebd593fa224f3135d3b9bd76e3b6035fe45aede6999c7122bd32f02",["sourceID"]="world:warcraft-quest-97288.html",["sourceStageStatus"]="OBJECTIVE_DESCRIPTION_COMPLETION",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/97288",["title"]="Unending Torment"},["following"]={},["meta"]="DELIVER\031?\03121\031?\031?\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\0312d961a808ebd593fa224f3135d3b9bd76e3b6035fe45aede6999c7122bd32f02\0312055:FINISHER",["people"]={[2055]="Master Apothecary Faranell"},["previous"]={},["profile"]="PARTIAL\031source_build,playability,chain_confirmation\031description\030objective\030completion\031An abomination's severed head appears to have been reattached more than once. Someone in Undercity may recognize it and explain the strange workmanship.\030The charge was to deliver the Abominable Head to Master Apothecary Faranell.\030The quest participant brought the head to Faranell. He recognized a cruel joke of Sylvanas's making and immediately saw another use for it.\0311,1,152,2,271,1,0\0302,1,76,2,128,1,0\0303,1,139,4,48,1,0\0312055,2,1,Master Apothecary Faranell\031\031\031",["quest"]="Unending Torment\031The charge was to deliver the Abominable Head to Master Ap