risty Grant admires the Pesterhide hyenas' unusual coats and wants their pelts sent to her sisters in Stormwind. Lacking fighting experience herself, she asks another traveler to gather them.\030The charge was to bring Kristy Pristine Pesterhide Pelts.\0311,1,192,2,271,1,0\0302,1,57,2,128,1,0\031\031\031\031",["quest"]="Pristine Pesterhide Pelts\031The charge was to bring Kristy Pristine Pesterhide Pelts.\031\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=0,["sourceBuild"]="CATALOG 1.60.1.70170; CAPTURE_FIELD_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="6fefa3d8c054bebe0029f16fe050a014bb308700331fa65cc41a1b7b19e3b8af",["sourceURL"]="https://tierhall.app/wow/quests/98155",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
