pare travelers needless deaths.\0311,1,211,2,271,1,0\0302,1,51,2,128,1,0\0303,1,102,4,48,1,0\0311253,2,1,Father Gavin\031\031\031",["quest"]="Rime's Wrath\031The charge was to kill Avala and retrieve its core.\0311253\031\031\031\031\031reference",["reference"]={["confidence"]="COMMUNITY_BETA_ACCOUNT",["licensing"]="Original authored paraphrase; factual source attribution, Warcraft setting Blizzard; no source dialogue redistributed",["qualification"]="Publisher-reported beta account; per-field capture build and current-server availability are not independently certified.",["referenceBuild"]=69913,["sourceBuild"]="CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceHash"]="9dcc7b2c97ca2b54f9c2189266bdff930528e9a0741c5ebc695fe123152b195b",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/99161",["sourceVersion"]="forever-community-accounts-2026-10-26"}},
